Package: jarvis-ollama
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Muhammad AbdElHay <mmAbdelhay@users.noreply.github.com>
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Depends: adduser, systemd
Section: misc
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/ollama/ollama
Description: Ollama local model server for @DISTRO_NAME@ (localhost only)
 Upstream Ollama release, SHA-256 pinned (version in
 /usr/share/doc/jarvis-ollama/UPSTREAM), CPU backends, run as the
 "ollama" system user on 127.0.0.1:11434 with models in /var/lib/ollama.
